--- Volumetric clouds ---

src/geography/cloud-volume.js adapts ray-box intersection, density-texture
sampling and front-to-back ray marching from the Three.js r180 example:
https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/blob/r180/examples/webgl_volume_cloud.html
Copyright © 2010-2025 three.js authors; the MIT license reproduced above applies.
The courseware adds its own cold/warm cloud density shapes, deterministic
sampling, moisture controls, shading and unfolding transition.
